{"id": "DfCs9WTt5mu", "title": "Video by toaidanh_", "description": "She came to the studio for a wedding portrait.\nHer son came to stop her.\n\nTo him, his mother was too old to fall in love again.\nTo her, it was simply wanting someone to share a meal with. Someone she could tell, “I’m a little tired today.”\n\nWe grow up and build lives of our own. Yet sometimes, we expect our parents to spend the rest of theirs waiting for us to come home.\n\nA show will coming soon to Showrunner iOS app! @showrunner.tv \n\nThe Healing Photo Studio — LOVE IN THE AUTUMN YEARS", "channel": "toaidanh_", "uploader_id": "46613229241", "uploader": "Danhtoai", "timestamp": 1793199636, "like_count": 680, "comment_count": 35, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-998315142547277a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.155, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOpjSQhyZblZ5nzAIPEHokAQhMPz44qiCXb1i8jjlG0VM8oXv3YohsSnoUhsQYpOwE8OMF97NYcBi_SdrBVSKPnZkdbdEQvYq3FvI8.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdoylU1bt6CKwFLGX-MLr7D9JMomGVicBTrc1BoLLz9HhHjwEkbCzHXV_rXgVI2IveDEKhnSdzbVdJaFx7HVbO-b&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=eos-JujKfYoQ7kNvwEScu-7&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=DcIz1rHUgBsgMDVIXDAXpg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTPUnybtzxiEM4lr1ATpOGr_-ZGJM7l12zGMnlxGYWyVQ&oe=6AF431EC", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 67.155, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "d